# "At the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice an artifact, enchantment, or token" (CR 701.21a, 603.2): Bot1 casts a Barrow Naughty and
# the 6/6 with two Black Lotuses and keeps Mox Pearl. At its next upkeep only the artifact is offered (not the Naughty, not the Sugarmaw itself,
# not another player's Mox Ruby); sacrificing Mox Pearl leaves the Sugarmaw untapped (CR 608.2c). The opponent's upkeep does not trigger it.
# The Sugarmaw has menace and trample.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x2
Mox Pearl
Barrow Naughty
Devouring Sugarmaw
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Island x20

